{"displayStem":"목동맥집의 국소 단면을 단순화한 모식도다. 점선은 근막집 경계이며 동맥과 속목정맥의 이름을 표시했다. X·Y의 위치 관계를 비교한다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육 목적으로 구성한 학습자료입니다."},{"kind":"provenance","text":"독립 제작 모식도 · 크기 비례 아님","links":[]}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C01 c01-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 470\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"구조 관계를 단순화한 교육용 모식도\"><rect width=\"800\" height=\"470\" fill=\"white\"></rect><text x=\"90\" y=\"50\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">앞</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"350\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">뒤</text><path d=\"M640 190C640 35 160 35 160 190C160 345 640 345 640 190\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"></path><ellipse cx=\"310\" cy=\"170\" rx=\"52\" ry=\"52\" stroke=\"#111\" fill=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></ellipse><ellipse cx=\"500\" cy=\"160\" rx=\"75\" ry=\"55\" stroke=\"#111\" fill=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></ellipse><text x=\"270\" y=\"177\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">동맥</text><text x=\"445\" y=\"167\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">속목정맥</text><text x=\"350\" y=\"280\" font-size=\"25\" style=\"font-size:25px\" fill=\"#111\">X</text><line x1=\"375\" y1=\"267\" x2=\"398\" y2=\"244\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line><ellipse cx=\"400\" cy=\"240\" rx=\"9\" ry=\"9\" stroke=\"#111\" fill=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></ellipse><ellipse cx=\"300\" cy=\"345\" rx=\"9\" ry=\"9\" stroke=\"#111\" fill=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></ellipse><text x=\"325\" y=\"353\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">Y</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">집 경계</text><line x1=\"550\" y1=\"288\" x2=\"565\" y2=\"265\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line></svg></div></div>"]}